{"data": [{"author_id": "1686750654759608320", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:52:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120258244614725780"], "id": "2120258244614725780", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "인류가 지난 2년 동안 AI 병목을 뚫겠다고 TSMC CoWoS 패키징, HBM 메모리, 345kV 전력망, 변압기, 액체냉각 용수까지 수천조 원을 쏟아부으며 난리를 쳤는데...\n\n결국 전체 3조 달러짜리 AI 문명의 궁극적인 단일 고장점(SPOF)이 '63세 젠슨 황의 생물학적 제로데이' 하나였다는 게 기가 막힙니다. https://t.co/e76lHHAxwl", "url": "https://x.com/iama12x/status/2120258244614725780"}, {"author_id": "2098424533820887040", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:29:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120267538483560912"], "id": "2120267538483560912", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026年11月8日腾讯新闻称英伟达出资数十亿美元帮日月光扩产先进封装，因为台积电CoWoS产能告急。芯片不是缺硅片，是缺封装，这一步为什么最难扩？ @grok\n\nTencent News reported on 8 November 2026 that Nvidia was putting billions into ASE advanced packaging as TSMC CoWoS capacity ran short. https://t.co/KZ72LXhbce", "url": "https://x.com/davidsun6366043/status/2120267538483560912"}, {"author_id": "1055142893688680449", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:26:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120266794866712701", "2120268261212180830"], "id": "2120266794866712701", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nvidia forward P/E under 18x is a pure mathematical optical illusion.\n\n​That multiple assumes +90% revenue growth in 2027, +68% in 2028, and +30% in 2029.  \n\n​That compound run pushes $NVDA past $850B in annual revenue in 3 years ( from $215B)\n\n​For that number to materialize,", "url": "https://x.com/TimelessCpnd/status/2120266794866712701"}, {"author_id": "1055142893688680449", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:32:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["212026679