teral behind it. $GOAI\n\n#Tejran\n\n$TSLA $ASML $MSFT https://t.co/WxOHjqUtPW", "url": "https://x.com/ConnieKrier/status/2120263852021739703"}, {"author_id": "2218722325", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:22:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120265991112519931"], "id": "2120265991112519931", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120239023545344311", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Secured convertible note changes the risk profile - someone with lender protections chose to come in at $GOAI, that's the part worth watching.\n\n#teenageers\n\n$TSLA $ASML $CRM https://t.co/6CxiiQx2eI", "url": "https://x.com/13Glak/status/2120265991112519931"}, {"author_id": "2569606548", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:06:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120261736993559029"], "id": "2120261736993559029", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 224, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120239385220137146", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A named investor committing real capital to $GOAI is exactly the kind of signal I want to see. Curious how fast Eva Live ramps now.\n\n#bb28\n\n$TSLA $NKE $ASML https://t.co/zq22Ceg1eO", "url": "https://x.com/sixgearind/status/2120261736993559029"}, {"author_id": "2235314596", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:53:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120258685599453192"], "id": "2120258685599453192", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120239279494627363", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Named backer on the filing is the part that matters here. $1.88M up to is fine as long as Dune actually funds it - $GOAI\n\n#bb28\n\n$TSLA $ASML $AA https://t.co/zs8zumpexl", "url": "https://x.com/ahmedmusa546/status/2120258685599453192