_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120238515825045797", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "12% secured convertible is a real vote of confidence for a small team. $GOAI getting runway lined up before it's needed is how you avoid desperate raises later.\n\n#VIVANT\n\n$TSLA $MU $ASML https://t.co/ZHD8SYzP9M", "url": "https://x.com/LaurenFrey69012/status/2120258881309790679"}, {"author_id": "1937404026523381760", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:17:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120264483990052897"], "id": "2120264483990052897", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "samsung's 2027 HBM memory is reportedly already sold out\n\nimagine starting an AI lab today. you can raise the money, hire the people, and still not get the chips for two years\n\nthe real moat in AI right now might be a purchase order. who do you think is locked out? https://t.co/v1GacgNmR2", "url": "https://x.com/prem_itx/status/2120264483990052897"}, {"author_id": "1573337013045993472", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:54:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120258797163712987"], "id": "2120258797163712987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120238541079036379", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Named money beats vague promises any day. Now $GOAI just has to actually deliver.\n\n#BBNaija\n\n$TSLA $META $ASML https://t.co/qyf8MSRkmZ", "url": "https://x.com/hbsik39623381/status/2120258797163712987"}, {"author_id": "1320772298442493952", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120265105174667327"], "id": "2120265105174667327", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120239198506750378", "type": "quoted"}], "text":